<title>USA: StreamLogic in venture with Diana unit.</title>
<headline>StreamLogic in venture with Diana unit.</headline>
<dateline>CHATSWORTH, Calif. 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>StreamLogic Corp said Wednesday it formed an Internet joint venture with Sattel Communications LLC, a subsidiary of Diana Corp.</p>
<p>The new venture, SatLogic LLC, markets network communications services, along with related hardware and software to Internet service providers (ISP).</p>
<p>SatLogic's network will have a national multi-service Internet access platform, and will offer ISPs an alternative to traditional capital-intensive private network options, the company said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
